sequenceDiagram
    participant User as End User
    participant App as FireFly App
    participant Auth as better-auth
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Okta as Okta IDP
    participant DBX as Databricks

    Note over User,DBX: SSO-SPN Authentication Flow
    User->>App: Access /sso-spn/login
    App->>Auth: Check session
    Auth-->>App: No session
    App->>User: Redirect to Okta login

    User->>Okta: Authenticate
    Okta-->>User: Return auth code
    User->>Auth: /api/auth/callback
    Auth->>Okta: Exchange code for tokens
    Okta-->>Auth: Access token + ID token
    Auth->>DB: Create session, store tokens

    Note over User,DBX: Organization Selection
    User->>App: Select organization
    App->>API: POST /api/oauth/set-org
    API->>DB: INSERT into oauthFlowMapping
    API->>DB: UPDATE session SET activeOrganizationId

    Note over User,DBX: Databricks API Calls (Using Org SPN)
    User->>App: Request Databricks data
    App->>DB: GET byodDatabricksSpns WHERE orgId
    DB-->>App: SPN clientId + clientSecret
    App->>DBX: OAuth token request (SPN credentials)
    DBX-->>App: Access token
    App->>DBX: API call with SPN token
    DBX-->>App: Data response
    App-->>User: Rendered data
